I exercise every day in the evening.
Sometimes, I run outside.
There is a small park near my apartment.
I run there.
But I also go to a nearby gym.
I go there exactly at half past five in the evening.
I finish my office work at five o'clock.
I come home by bus.
After that, I quickly walk to the gym.
The gym is very close to my flat.
I exercise there for one hour.
I return home exactly at half past six.
